{
    "word": "documentarian",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "2d5e2fc7-5853-3cab-a46e-68b75c90bde8",
                "word": "documentarian",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "68128412-0765-41f7-b6ac-423e9a9fa629",
                        "entry_id": "2d5e2fc7-5853-3cab-a46e-68b75c90bde8",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "documentarians"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7eae2ef3-a129-393a-9fcc-6146623ecd0f",
                        "entry_id": "2d5e2fc7-5853-3cab-a46e-68b75c90bde8",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A person whose profession is to create documentary films."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "47ed2330-769a-4a03-8489-e56ff6d363c3",
                                "sense_id": "7eae2ef3-a129-393a-9fcc-6146623ecd0f",
                                "text": "As film tourism becomes a rising field of interest, this portion of documentary history is in danger of repetition unless documentarians utilize the nobler ideas of documentary in order to cultivate a deeper understanding between people, filmmaker, and audience."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ee477ae5-11e8-36e1-b7df-5bb087e42d18",
                        "entry_id": "2d5e2fc7-5853-3cab-a46e-68b75c90bde8",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A person who writes software documentation."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f7e2c194-79c5-4eec-b746-0d251c010eea",
                                "sense_id": "ee477ae5-11e8-36e1-b7df-5bb087e42d18",
                                "text": "After you have gone through all these steps, you are ready to tackle your company's documentation problems. You have also become an experienced systems documentarian..."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d3c78f62-464b-42e2-bfa8-d5ba2b4cc528",
                                "sense_id": "ee477ae5-11e8-36e1-b7df-5bb087e42d18",
                                "text": "Have you considered hiring a technical writer or documentarian to assist in the production of user manuals?"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ba14020f-206b-3d3b-a83e-cde3e8865105",
                        "entry_id": "2d5e2fc7-5853-3cab-a46e-68b75c90bde8",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A person who cares about communication and documentation."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "cf2908cd-d8ab-42ff-8b72-cf87ce80e8dc",
                                "sense_id": "ba14020f-206b-3d3b-a83e-cde3e8865105",
                                "text": "Expanding the meaning of documentarian to include folks of any job title is important. Historically, people writing documentation might be called either a tech writer or a programmer, but there wasn’t a name for someone who cares about communication and documentation. We hope to change this."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3a2c1a12-beed-433c-9898-6b7caa034934",
                                "sense_id": "ba14020f-206b-3d3b-a83e-cde3e8865105",
                                "text": "...the developer with an aptitude for or an interest in writing assumes the task of documentarian."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0b50d8fc-06b1-4fd4-9b1a-7c512a85c9a9",
                                "sense_id": "ba14020f-206b-3d3b-a83e-cde3e8865105",
                                "text": "I recently co-organised the Build your Docs career conference together with the Write the Docs (WTD) community. This was the fourth collaboration between the organisations and focused on the technical writing profession ... The talks provided lots of practical advice on how we can, as documentarians, learn in such a way as to maximise our potential for development in the future."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e3e52255-0fee-3bdc-a99d-73b503c8bf18",
                        "entry_id": "2d5e2fc7-5853-3cab-a46e-68b75c90bde8",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Somebody who advocates the documentary hypothesis."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "attributive",
                            "sometimes"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b458352d-b3c2-4f71-99f7-84f01c016dd1",
                        "source_entry_id": "2d5e2fc7-5853-3cab-a46e-68b75c90bde8",
                        "source_sense_description": "person whose profession is to create documentary films",
                        "target_lang_word": "Dokumentarfilmer",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Dokumentarfilmer",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "defa87c7-8ead-32a7-8bd4-4c5ce16e0bfd",
                                        "entry_id": "688d40b0-3cbc-37c8-b824-a4cf96b7e9b7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "(männliche^☆) Person, die Dokumentarfilme dreht"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bd5608f5-92aa-4f27-a050-443e0720ac28",
                                                "sense_id": "defa87c7-8ead-32a7-8bd4-4c5ce16e0bfd",
                                                "text": "„Pennebaker, 2012 als erster Dokumentarfilmer überhaupt mit einem Ehrenoscar ausgezeichnet, war nicht nur ein Chronist der jüngeren US-Musikgeschichte.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "107143fb-2750-433e-b669-3f32944c7eaf",
                                                "sense_id": "defa87c7-8ead-32a7-8bd4-4c5ce16e0bfd",
                                                "text": "„Wie soll man als Dokumentarfilmer filmisch mit Nähe und Distanz umgehen?“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c8a70f68-2a30-4708-b30a-ccacaa5f0ded",
                                                "sense_id": "defa87c7-8ead-32a7-8bd4-4c5ce16e0bfd",
                                                "text": "„Er ist Amerikas erfolgreichster, originellster und wohl am meisten gefürchteter Dokumentarfilmer.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ca774d61-eb04-4e04-9a2b-526e3e036005",
                        "source_entry_id": "2d5e2fc7-5853-3cab-a46e-68b75c90bde8",
                        "source_sense_description": "person whose profession is to create documentary films",
                        "target_lang_word": "Dokumentarfilmerin",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Dokumentarfilmerin",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "294d86e7-e44f-3738-afb5-98ad2208a4e6",
                                        "entry_id": "924299eb-14c3-384b-9552-6baa6c083105",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "weibliche Person, die Dokumentarfilme dreht"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0405a8e9-d2fa-4f59-a5af-0b6aab4d704e",
                                                "sense_id": "294d86e7-e44f-3738-afb5-98ad2208a4e6",
                                                "text": "„Ich habe während meiner Arbeit als Dokumentarfilmerin in Ländern anderer Kulturen viele Rituale beobachtet und Menschen getroffen, die etwas gesehen haben, was ich nicht wahrzunehmen vermochte.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3dade9da-d8f1-4498-b38c-034e3b9fb3ac",
                        "source_entry_id": "2d5e2fc7-5853-3cab-a46e-68b75c90bde8",
                        "source_sense_description": "person whose profession is to create documentary films",
                        "target_lang_word": "Dokumentarist",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Dokumentarist",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "53c55422-230b-3243-aeb2-be79b4df35f4",
                                        "entry_id": "b8c2877a-6230-3006-9dad-5ede63722fc5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Person, die Informationen als Schriftstück, Film oder Ähnliches zusammenstellt und verarbeitet"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0474f9eb-3f8f-4adc-a229-2c991cd29e6e",
                                                "sense_id": "53c55422-230b-3243-aeb2-be79b4df35f4",
                                                "text": "„Ich habe deine Karriere all die Jahre verfolgt, als Dokumentarist war ich an der Quelle und habe unzählige Artikel über dich registriert und gesammelt.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "98266d4a-3727-4e92-96f5-8940283bf6c7",
                                                "sense_id": "53c55422-230b-3243-aeb2-be79b4df35f4",
                                                "text": "„Der Dokumentarist möchte vor allem über die Welt vor seinen Augen informieren.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3edc17d3-d5c7-4457-a69d-05da3d99c57d",
                                                "sense_id": "53c55422-230b-3243-aeb2-be79b4df35f4",
                                                "text": "„Der Dokumentarist Volker Koepp hat über das, was in der großen Rechnung nicht aufgegangen ist, mehrere Filme gedreht.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "bf54c2c3-b9b5-4594-b148-1549d8d82277",
                        "source_entry_id": "2d5e2fc7-5853-3cab-a46e-68b75c90bde8",
                        "source_sense_description": "person whose profession is to create documentary films",
                        "target_lang_word": "Dokumentaristin",
